innen te dringen om te ontdekken wat hij verborgen houdt. Elke poging wordt uitdagender, want de buurman leert van je acties en past zijn gedrag aan.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"434\">🎮 <strong data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"432\">Kenmerken</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"636\">\r\n<li data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"473\">\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"473\">Originele <strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"466\">Nintendo Switch</strong> game</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"504\">\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"504\">Spannende stealth gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"527\">\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"527\">Uitdagende puzzels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"588\">\r\n<p data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"588\">De AI leert van je acties voor steeds nieuwe uitdagingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"636\">\r\n<p data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"636\">Geschikt voor spelers die van spanning houden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"655\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"653\">Staat</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<li data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"674\">\r\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"674\">In nette staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"709\">Volledig getest en werkt perfect</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"734\">📦 <strong data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"732\">Verzending</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"788\">\r\n<li data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"788\">\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"788\">Kan verzonden worden via <strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"788\">brievenbuspost (€2,99)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"856\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Perfect voor fans van puzzelgames, stealth en een beetje spanning!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>",
